{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12101040","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12101040","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1210104001:0":{"text":"보아하니 우리만 바다에서 조난을 당한 게 아닌가 봐요. 누가 버린 배일까요...","source_cn":"看来在海上遇难的人不止我们，不知道是谁弃下了这艘船……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2DE13715B09BA1F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1210104002:0":{"text":"어때, 치피? 쓸만한 것 같아?","source_cn":"怎么样，满满？还能用吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3034201EC5849B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1210104003:0":{"text":"겉보기엔... 문제없는 것 같아! 조금 손상되긴 했지만, 나무판자로 때우면 괜찮을 거야.","source_cn":"看起来……没问题！只有一点小损伤，用木板补一补能修好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7CB0480D715C1A46","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1210104004:1":{"text":"근데 이 배로 갈아타도 괜찮을까요? 보세요, 여기 이상한 돛이 달려 있어요.","source_cn":"不过，我们要换用这艘船吗？你们看，还挂着这么奇怪的船帆。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xACFC856CFFBF3FA9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:6::2":{"text":"뼈와 발톱이 그려진 낡은 깃발","source_cn":"画着骨头和利爪的破旧旗帜","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x596E97F5296A42B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1210104005:0":{"text":"음, 이게 무슨 모양이죠? 발톱 같기도, 뼈 같기도 한 게...","source_cn":"唔，看不出来是什么标志，有点像爪子，也很像骨头……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB887F55D569C22AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1210104006:0":{"text":"다른 사람이 버리고 간 배 같긴 한데, 저희가 타도되는 걸까요...?","source_cn":"这是别人的弃船吧，我们可以借用吗……？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x95F37050D314FF89","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"다른 사람이 버리고 간 배 같긴 한데, 저희가 타도되는 걸까요...?","female":"다른 사람이 버리고 간 배 같긴 한데, 저희가 타도되는 걸까요...?","variant_male_record_index":"127417","variant_female_record_index":"127418","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1210104006":{"text":"다른 사람이 버리고 간 배 같긴 한데, 저희가 타도되는 걸까요...?","source_cn":"这是别人的弃船吧，我们可以借用吗……？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x95F37050D314FF89","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"다른 사람이 버리고 간 배 같긴 한데, 저희가 타도되는 걸까요...?","female":"다른 사람이 버리고 간 배 같긴 한데, 저희가 타도되는 걸까요...?","variant_male_record_index":"127417","variant_female_record_index":"127418","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1210104007:0":{"text":"드디어 이 섬에서 나갈 수 있겠네요... 에취!","source_cn":"总算可以离开这座岛了……阿欠！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E867C51CC2A6A87","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1210104008:0":{"text":"여기 더 있다가는 얼어 죽겠어요.","source_cn":"再待下去，满满都要冻生病了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C1C1BF9AB7D6103","va